USAGE
        DOc

DESCRIPTION
        Shows a short description of what the FPAC node offers,
        with examples: finding a station in the White Pages,
        connecting by callsign alone or to a ROSE address, and the
        main commands. The text is in French or in English, after
        the language chosen with LAng.
        The sysop can adapt it: the files are _doc.en and _doc.fr
        in the help directory of FPAC.
